This repository-only candidate documents the active-release readback convention.
A later Human-authorized deployment may generate `/opt/tiny-ipa/current/REVISION`
from the reviewed GitHub commit or tag. The VPS copy must match both the
intended GitHub identity and the live `/api/version` response before public
activation.
